      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "One raven alone, the only subject in an empty frame. Full body side view, standing upright, wings folded against the body, head in profile with the beak pointing toward the right edge of the frame. Hard directional studio light from the upper left, deep shadow across the near flank, bright rim light tracing the back and the beak. Sharp individual feather detail and crisp scalloped wing coverts. The bird floats free against a seamless mid-grey studio backdrop that holds one even tone across the entire frame, empty above and below it. Generous margin on all four sides. Tack sharp, high contrast."
      ]
    },
